{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Retro Recorder》是一款把語音即時轉為文字的錄音工具，內置裝置端人工智能引擎，無需連接網絡，錄音與轉寫內容都只留在自己的裝置上。特別適合需要整理會議記錄、訪談筆記或隨時速記靈感的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>即時轉錄支援多語言</h2>\n<p>說話時文字即時顯示於畫面，支援英文、西班牙文、阿拉伯文、俄文、德文、中文、日文等多種語言，更能於同一句話中自動切換。錄音可切換內置或外接麥克風、藍牙耳機，並具備智能降噪與迴音消除。轉錄結果可手動修正、一鍵複製或分享，原聲錄音亦會一併保留。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-241-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-242-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-243-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-244-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-245-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-246-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Retro Recorder: Voice &amp; Text</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.414829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T19:36:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:22.994163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:22.994163+00:00","content_hash":"9ee8fd4bca38ecaa107407b4097a86f06ecb0a6920f01a8f148285898e0ff749","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}